  m_text: "After a great storm, the ancient realm named Orb of the Tides \u2013 keeper
    of the world\u2019s gravitational\r\nbalance- has being lost and this is the
    journey to retrieve the balance and save the world.\r\nThe player, a skilled
    explorer, packed with a buoyancy suit to traverse dangerous floating islands,\r\ndangerous
    ruins in earth and fog filled ruins. The buoyancy suit is essential for navigation.\r\nFloating
    islands are guarded by and underwater regions are guarded by currents and predators.\r\nA
    hermit may provide guidance and help the user in the journey.\r\nThe Orb is hidden
    in a place named Temple of Tides\r\nThe world will collapse if the Orb is not
    restored in time.\r\nGoal: Retrieve the Orb before the gravitational instability
    destroys the remaining world."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
